@conference
title: Step 3 of 4 — Set the caucus instruction
new-page: true
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
Q.opposition_budget_stage = 3;
Q.opposition_budget_barons_demand =
    "name an administrable local beneficiary and do not rescue the cabinet for free";
Q.opposition_budget_spring_demand =
    "keep equality and care visible in the final public line";
Q.opposition_budget_labor_demand =
    "put wages, staffing and enforcement ahead of a tactical headline";
Q.opposition_budget_progressives_demand =
    "publish a deadline and protect housing or equality from deletion";
Q.opposition_budget_razem_demand =
    "no yes vote for promises that are neither costed nor written into the bill";
Q.opposition_budget_pps_demand =
    "protect wages and municipal services, even if the club must vote no";
!}

= Demands and red lines, not percentages

The conference must reconcile **[+ opposition_budget_priority_1 +]** with **[+
opposition_budget_priority_2 +]**. Choose how firmly the parliamentary club
will bind itself. Any likely dissent will be named before you choose the final
Sejm tactic.

<details class="ledger-disclosure">
<summary><span>Faction red lines</span><b>Why MPs may rebel</b></summary>
<div class="disclosure-body">
[? if barons_active: <div class="ledger-note"><b>[+ barons_name +]:</b> [+ opposition_budget_barons_demand +].</div>?]
[? if spring_active: <div class="ledger-note"><b>[+ spring_name +]:</b> [+ opposition_budget_spring_demand +].</div>?]
[? if labor_active: <div class="ledger-note"><b>[+ labor_name +]:</b> [+ opposition_budget_labor_demand +].</div>?]
[? if progressives_active: <div class="ledger-note"><b>[+ progressives_name +]:</b> [+ opposition_budget_progressives_demand +].</div>?]
[? if razem_active: <div class="ledger-note"><b>Razem:</b> [+ opposition_budget_razem_demand +].</div>?]
[? if pps_active: <div class="ledger-note"><b>PPS:</b> [+ opposition_budget_pps_demand +].</div>?]
</div>
</details>

