@conference_negotiate
title: Negotiate one common instruction
subtitle: Cost: 1 party resource. Both priorities remain; reservations are published.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The conference has no staff capacity left for a negotiated text.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; opposition_budget_conference_code = 1; opposition_budget_conference_management = "Negotiated common instruction"; party_unity += 2; razem_cooperation += 2
go-to: conference_result

@conference_promise
title: Promise the omitted demand in the next manifesto
subtitle: Holds the room today, but creates an auditable promise rather than enacted policy.
on-arrival: opposition_budget_conference_code = 2; opposition_budget_conference_management = "Future manifesto promise"; budget_promises += 2; party_unity -= 1; razem_dissent += 3
go-to: conference_result

@conference_free_vote
title: Permit a free vote
subtitle: Honest factional autonomy; the final roll call will name dissenters.
on-arrival: opposition_budget_conference_code = 3; opposition_budget_conference_management = "Free vote"; party_unity -= 3
go-to: conference_result

@conference_discipline
title: Impose parliamentary discipline
subtitle: A clear line with a risk of public defiance.
on-arrival: opposition_budget_conference_code = 4; opposition_budget_conference_management = "Imposed discipline"; party_unity += 1; razem_dissent += 4; progressives_dissent += 2
go-to: conference_result

@conference_result
title: Step 4 of 4 — Choose the parliamentary tactic
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const leftDelegation = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.left_seats) || 0));
const selectedPriorities = [
    Number(Q.opposition_budget_priority_1_code) || 0,
    Number(Q.opposition_budget_priority_2_code) || 0
];
const budgetFactions = [
    {id: "barons", seats: "left_barons_seats", name: Q.barons_name,
        representative: "Tomasz Trela", priorities: [2, 5, 9, 11, 14]},
    {id: "spring", seats: "left_spring_seats", name: Q.spring_name,
        representative: "Krzysztof Śmiszek", priorities: [4, 7, 10, 15]},
    {id: "labor", seats: "left_labor_seats", name: Q.labor_name,
        representative: "Agnieszka Dziemianowicz-Bąk",
        priorities: [1, 2, 7, 12, 13, 14]},
    {id: "progressives", seats: "left_progressives_seats",
        name: Q.progressives_name, representative: "Katarzyna Kotula",
        priorities: [3, 4, 8, 10, 15]},
    {id: "razem", seats: "razem_seats", name: "Razem",
        representative: "Adrian Zandberg", priorities: [1, 2, 3, 12, 13]},
    {id: "pps", seats: "left_pps_seats", name: "PPS",
        representative: "Joanna Senyszyn", priorities: [1, 2, 5, 7, 11, 14]}
];
const activeBudgetFactions = budgetFactions.filter(function(faction) {
    return Q[faction.id + "_active"] && Q[faction.id + "_in_left"];
});
const strengthTotal = activeBudgetFactions.reduce(function(total, faction) {
    return total + Math.max(0, Number(Q[faction.id + "_strength"]) || 0);
}, 0);
let calculatedRebels = 0;
const rebelNames = [];
const mismatchNames = [];
for (const faction of activeBudgetFactions) {
    const represented = selectedPriorities.some(function(priority) {
        return faction.priorities.includes(priority);
    });
    const dissent = Math.max(0, Number(Q[faction.id + "_dissent"]) || 0);
    let factionSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q[faction.seats]) || 0));
    if (factionSeats <= 0 && strengthTotal > 0) {
        factionSeats = Math.round(
            leftDelegation *
            Math.max(0, Number(Q[faction.id + "_strength"]) || 0) /
            strengthTotal
        );
    }
    let rebelRate = represented ? 0 : 0.08;
    if (Q.opposition_budget_conference_code == 2) rebelRate += 0.08;
    if (Q.opposition_budget_conference_code == 3) rebelRate +=
        represented ? 0.10 : 0.28;
    if (Q.opposition_budget_conference_code == 4 && !represented) {
        rebelRate += 0.12;
    }
    rebelRate += Math.max(0, dissent - 50) / 220;
    if (Q.opposition_budget_conference_code == 1) rebelRate *= 0.45;
    const factionRebels = Math.min(
        factionSeats,
        Math.max(0, Math.round(factionSeats * rebelRate))
    );
    if (!represented) mismatchNames.push(faction.name);
    if (factionRebels > 0) {
        rebelNames.push(faction.representative);
        if (factionRebels > 1) {
            rebelNames.push(
                (factionRebels - 1) + " other " + faction.name + " MPs"
            );
        }
        calculatedRebels += factionRebels;
    }
}
Q.opposition_budget_rebel_count = Math.min(leftDelegation, calculatedRebels);
Q.opposition_budget_priority_mismatch = mismatchNames.length
    ? mismatchNames.join(", ") + " lack a preferred priority"
    : "Every active current sees one preferred priority";
Q.opposition_budget_named_rebels = rebelNames.length
    ? rebelNames.join(", ")
    : "None";
!}

= Club instruction: [+ opposition_budget_conference_management +]

Demands: **[+ opposition_budget_priority_1 +]** and **[+
opposition_budget_priority_2 +]**.

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">Before the vote</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Likely dissenters</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_rebel_count +] MPs</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">[+ opposition_budget_priority_mismatch +].</div></div>

[? if opposition_budget_rebel_count > 0: <details class="ledger-disclosure">
<summary><span>Likely dissenters</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_rebel_count +] MPs</b></summary>
<div class="disclosure-body">[+ opposition_budget_named_rebels +]. These are
possible deviations; the final roll call records how they actually vote.</div>
</details>?]

Now choose what Lewica files and how it votes.

- @tactic_shadow
- @tactic_amendments
- @tactic_bargain
- @tactic_abstain
- @tactic_against

@choose_tactic
go-to: tactics

@tactics
title: Step 4 of 4 — Choose the parliamentary tactic
new-page: true
on-arrival: opposition_budget_stage = 4

The government knows Lewica's two priorities and the conference rule. Choose
what is actually filed and how the club will vote.

- @tactic_shadow
- @tactic_amendments
- @tactic_bargain
- @tactic_abstain
- @tactic_against

@tactic_shadow
title: Publish a costed shadow budget and vote no
subtitle: Cost: 1 party resource. Builds issue ownership, credibility and media attention—not state capacity.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Costing and publishing the full programme requires one party resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; opposition_budget_tactic_code = 1; opposition_budget_tactic = "Costed shadow budget"; annual_budget_posture = "Vote no"
go-to: resolve

@tactic_amendments
title: Submit two named amendments and vote on the government's answer
subtitle: Cost: 1 party resource. The cabinet rules on each demand; Lewica then votes no on the amended bill.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Drafting and whipping two amendments requires one party resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; opposition_budget_tactic_code = 2; opposition_budget_tactic = "Two named Sejm amendments"; annual_budget_posture = "Vote no after amendments"
go-to: resolve

@tactic_bargain
title: Bargain for named concessions
subtitle: Cost: 1 party resource. Best chance of a concession; the cabinet's exact answer sets a support, abstention or no-vote line.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A written negotiation and monitoring file requires one party resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; opposition_budget_tactic_code = 3; opposition_budget_tactic = "Named-concession bargain"; annual_budget_posture = "Conditional line"
go-to: resolve

@tactic_abstain
title: Abstain and let the government own its budget
subtitle: No concession, no Lewica yes votes and no policy credit.
on-arrival: opposition_budget_tactic_code = 4; opposition_budget_tactic = "Unconditional abstention"; annual_budget_posture = "Abstain"
go-to: resolve

@tactic_against
title: Vote against without publishing a shadow budget
subtitle: A clean opposition vote, but no alternative programme to audit or own.
on-arrival: opposition_budget_tactic_code = 5; opposition_budget_tactic = "Straight opposition vote"; annual_budget_posture = "Vote no"
go-to: resolve

@resolve
title: Result — Cabinet answers and the real Sejm budget vote
new-page: true
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
Q.opposition_budget_stage = 5;
const relationByGovernment = Q.government_party == "pis"
    ? Number(Q.pis_relation) || 0
    : (Q.government_party == "ko"
        ? Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0
        : (Q.government_party == "psl"
            ? Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0
            : Number(Q.p2050_relation) || 0));
const conferenceBonus = Q.opposition_budget_conference_code == 1
    ? 8
    : (Q.opposition_budget_conference_code == 4 ? 3 : 0);
const pivotalBonus = Q.opposition_budget_left_is_pivotal ? 16 : 0;
const leftPowerShare = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        1,
        (Number(Q.opposition_budget_left_seats) || 0) /
            Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460)
    )
);
const powerBonus = Math.round(leftPowerShare * 24);
Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.negotiation_leverage) || 0) * 0.55 +
    relationByGovernment * 0.35 + conferenceBonus +
    pivotalBonus + powerBonus
);
Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_threshold =
    Q.government_party == "pis" ? 54 : 46;
Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1 =
    "Amendment: " + Q.opposition_budget_priority_1;
Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2 =
    "Amendment: " + Q.opposition_budget_priority_2;

if (Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code == 2) {
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed =
        Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_score >=
            Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_threshold ? 1 : 0;
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2_passed =
        Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_score >=
            Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_threshold + 12 ? 1 : 0;
    Q.annual_budget_posture = "Vote no after amendments";
} else if (Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code == 3) {
    const bargainScore = Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_score + 10;
    Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_score = bargainScore;
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed =
        bargainScore >= Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_threshold ? 1 : 0;
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2_passed =
        bargainScore >= Q.opposition_budget_negotiation_threshold + 12 ? 1 : 0;
    if (
        Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed &&
        Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2_passed &&
        Q.opposition_budget_left_is_pivotal
    ) {
        Q.annual_budget_posture = "Conditional support";
    } else if (Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed) {
        Q.annual_budget_posture = "Abstain on named concession";
    } else {
        Q.annual_budget_posture = "Vote no — bargain refused";
    }
}
Q.opposition_budget_amendments_passed =
    Number(Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed) +
    Number(Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2_passed);
if (!Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed) {
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1 += " — cabinet refused";
} else {
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1 += " — cabinet accepted into the bill";
}
if (!Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2_passed) {
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2 += " — cabinet refused";
} else {
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2 += " — cabinet accepted into the bill";
}
if (Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code != 2 &&
    Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code != 3) {
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1 = "No amendment filed";
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2 = "No amendment filed";
}

const chamberTotal = Math.max(1, Math.round(Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460));
const leftSeats = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(chamberTotal, Math.round(Number(Q.left_seats) || 0))
);
const governmentStress =
    (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 0) +
    (Q.caretaker_government ? 12 : 0) +
    (!Q.government_has_confidence ? 8 : 0);
const governmentDefections = Math.min(
    Q.opposition_budget_government_seats,
    Math.max(0, Math.round((governmentStress - 35) / 8))
);
Q.annual_budget_government_yes =
    Q.opposition_budget_government_seats - governmentDefections;
Q.annual_budget_government_abstain = governmentDefections;

const socialShare = Number(Q.annual_budget_social_share) || 17;
const defenceShare = Number(Q.annual_budget_defence_share) || 4.6;
const deficitShare = Number(Q.annual_budget_deficit_share) || 4.5;
const socialEnough =
    socialShare >= 18.0 ||
    (Number(Q.annual_budget_year) == 2020 && socialShare >= 17.6);
const outrageousFrame =
    (socialShare < 16.8 && deficitShare > 5.3) ||
    (socialShare < 17.2 && defenceShare > 5.6);
if (Q.annual_budget_posture == "Conditional support" && !socialEnough) {
    Q.annual_budget_posture =
        "Abstain on named concession";
}
const factionVotes = [
    {id: "barons", seatsKey: "left_barons_seats", social: 17.2, defence: 4.8, deficit: 4.2},
    {id: "spring", seatsKey: "left_spring_seats", social: 19.5, defence: 4.2, deficit: 5.0},
    {id: "labor", seatsKey: "left_labor_seats", social: 20.2, defence: 4.0, deficit: 5.6},
    {id: "progressives", seatsKey: "left_progressives_seats", social: 19.2, defence: 4.1, deficit: 5.1},
    {id: "razem", seatsKey: "razem_seats", social: 20.6, defence: 3.9, deficit: 5.8},
    {id: "pps", seatsKey: "left_pps_seats", social: 19.6, defence: 4.3, deficit: 5.3}
];
let autoLeftYes = 0;
let autoLeftNo = 0;
let autoLeftAbstain = 0;
for (const faction of factionVotes) {
    if (!Q[faction.id + "_active"] || !Q[faction.id + "_in_left"]) continue;
    const seats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q[faction.seatsKey]) || 0));
    if (seats <= 0) continue;
    const dissent = Math.max(0, Number(Q[faction.id + "_dissent"]) || 0);
    let alignment =
        100 -
        Math.abs(socialShare - faction.social) * 14 -
        Math.abs(defenceShare - faction.defence) * 22 -
        Math.abs(deficitShare - faction.deficit) * 12 -
        dissent * 0.30;
    if (Q.opposition_budget_conference_code == 1) alignment += 4;
    if (Q.opposition_budget_conference_code == 4) alignment -= 4;
    alignment = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, alignment));
    if (Q.annual_budget_posture == "Conditional support") {
        const yesSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(seats * alignment / 100));
        autoLeftYes += yesSeats;
        autoLeftNo += Math.max(0, seats - yesSeats);
    } else if (
        Q.annual_budget_posture == "Abstain" ||
        Q.annual_budget_posture == "Abstain on named concession"
    ) {
        const yesSeats = socialEnough && alignment >= 75
            ? Math.round(seats * 0.25)
            : 0;
        const noSeats = alignment < 35
            ? Math.round(seats * 0.55)
            : Math.round(seats * 0.25);
        autoLeftYes += Math.max(0, Math.min(seats, yesSeats));
        autoLeftNo += Math.max(
            0,
            Math.min(seats - yesSeats, noSeats)
        );
        autoLeftAbstain += Math.max(
            0,
            seats - yesSeats - noSeats
        );
    } else {
        const noSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(seats * 0.70));
        const abstainSeats = seats - noSeats;
        autoLeftNo += noSeats;
        autoLeftAbstain += Math.max(0, abstainSeats);
    }
}
const assignedLeftSeats = autoLeftYes + autoLeftNo + autoLeftAbstain;
if (assignedLeftSeats < leftSeats) {
    autoLeftAbstain += leftSeats - assignedLeftSeats;
}
Q.annual_budget_left_yes = Math.max(0, Math.min(leftSeats, autoLeftYes));
Q.annual_budget_left_no = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(leftSeats - Q.annual_budget_left_yes, autoLeftNo)
);
Q.annual_budget_left_abstain = Math.max(
    0,
    leftSeats - Q.annual_budget_left_yes - Q.annual_budget_left_no
);
if (Q.annual_budget_left_yes > 0 && outrageousFrame) {
    Q.annual_budget_outrageous_support = 1;
    Q.party_unity -= 4;
    Q.public_trust -= 3;
    Q.razem_dissent += 8;
    Q.labor_credibility -= 4;
}
const rebels = Math.max(
    0,
    leftSeats - Q.annual_budget_left_yes
);
let externalYes = Math.max(
    0,
    Number(Q.opposition_budget_preview_external_yes) || 0
);
let externalAbstain = Math.max(
    0,
    Number(Q.opposition_budget_preview_external_abstain) || 0
);
const alignedLeftSplinters = Math.min(
    Q.opposition_budget_other_opposition_seats,
    Math.max(
        0,
        Math.round(
            Number(Q.opposition_budget_preview_aligned_splinters) || 0
        )
    )
);
if (Q.annual_budget_posture == "Conditional support") {
    externalYes += alignedLeftSplinters;
} else if (
    Q.annual_budget_posture == "Abstain" ||
    Q.annual_budget_posture == "Abstain on named concession"
) {
    externalAbstain += alignedLeftSplinters;
}
externalYes = Math.min(
    Q.opposition_budget_other_opposition_seats,
    externalYes
);
externalAbstain = Math.min(
    Q.opposition_budget_other_opposition_seats - externalYes,
    externalAbstain
);
Q.annual_budget_external_yes = externalYes;
Q.annual_budget_external_abstain = externalAbstain;
Q.annual_budget_external_no = Math.max(
    0,
    Q.opposition_budget_other_opposition_seats -
        externalYes - externalAbstain
);
Q.opposition_budget_external_support_basis = externalYes > 0
    ? (Q.opposition_budget_government_agreement_yes > 0
        ? "Kukiz-aligned agreement votes plus any named splinter or supply pact"
        : "Named splinters and an explicit supply pact")
    : (externalAbstain > 0
        ? "Recorded absences and abstentions outside Lewica"
        : "No support outside the cabinet and Lewica");
Q.annual_budget_yes =
    Q.annual_budget_government_yes + Q.annual_budget_left_yes +
        Q.annual_budget_external_yes;
Q.annual_budget_no =
    Q.annual_budget_external_no + Q.annual_budget_left_no;
Q.annual_budget_abstain =
    Q.annual_budget_government_abstain + Q.annual_budget_left_abstain +
        Q.annual_budget_external_abstain;
Q.annual_budget_present =
    Q.annual_budget_yes + Q.annual_budget_no + Q.annual_budget_abstain;
Q.annual_budget_threshold = Q.annual_budget_no + 1;
Q.annual_budget_passed =
    Q.annual_budget_present >=
        Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_quorum_floor) || 230) &&
    Q.annual_budget_yes > Q.annual_budget_no ? 1 : 0;
Q.annual_budget_margin = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? Q.annual_budget_yes - Q.annual_budget_no
    : 0;
Q.annual_budget_shortfall = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? 0
    : Math.max(0, Q.annual_budget_no + 1 - Q.annual_budget_yes);
Q.annual_budget_strategy = Q.opposition_budget_tactic;
Q.annual_budget_concession = Q.opposition_budget_amendments_passed
    ? (Q.opposition_budget_amendments_passed == 2
        ? Q.opposition_budget_priority_1 + " and " +
            Q.opposition_budget_priority_2
        : Q.opposition_budget_priority_1)
    : "None enacted at the Sejm vote";
Q.annual_budget_negotiation_success =
    Q.opposition_budget_amendments_passed > 0 ? 1 : 0;
Q.annual_budget_concession_strength =
    Q.opposition_budget_amendments_passed;
Q.annual_budget_result = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? Q.opposition_budget_tactic + " — budget passed " +
        Q.annual_budget_yes + " to " + Q.annual_budget_no
    : Q.opposition_budget_tactic + " — budget defeated by " +
        Q.annual_budget_shortfall;
Q["annual_budget_done_" + Q.annual_budget_year] = 1;
Q["annual_budget_passed_" + Q.annual_budget_year] =
    Q.annual_budget_passed;
Q.budget_deadline_active = Q.annual_budget_passed ? 0 : 1;

if (Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code == 1) {
    Q.opposition_budget_issue_ownership += 5;
    Q.opposition_budget_credibility += 4;
    Q.opposition_budget_media_attention += 4;
    Q.media_capacity += 2;
    Q.public_trust += 1;
}

Q.opposition_budget_audit_pending = 1;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_done = 0;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_year = Q.annual_budget_year;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_fiscal_year = Q.annual_budget_fiscal_year;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_tactic = Q.opposition_budget_tactic;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_tactic_code = Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_budget_passed = Q.annual_budget_passed;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_1_code =
    Q.opposition_budget_priority_1_code;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_2_code =
    Q.opposition_budget_priority_2_code;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_1_enacted =
    Q.annual_budget_passed ? Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed : 0;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_2_enacted =
    Q.annual_budget_passed ? Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2_passed : 0;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_enacted =
    Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_1_enacted ||
    Q.opposition_budget_audit_priority_2_enacted ? 1 : 0;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_amendment_1 =
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_1;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_amendment_2 =
    Q.opposition_budget_amendment_2;
Q.opposition_budget_audit_result = "Audit due next year";

/* Compatibility fields for the retained 2019–20 Senate docket. */
if (Q.annual_budget_year == 2019) {
    Q.budget_2019_done = 1;
    Q.budget_2019_ratified =
        Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code == 1 ? 1 : 0;
    Q.budget_2019_rebels = rebels > 0 ? 1 : 0;
    Q.budget_2019_backing = Math.max(
        0,
        leftSeats ? Math.round((leftSeats - rebels) * 100 / leftSeats) : 0
    );
    Q.budget_2019_vetoes = 0;
}
if (Q.annual_budget_year == 2020) {
    Q.budget_2020_done = 1;
    Q.budget_2020_ratified =
        Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code == 1 ? 1 : 0;
    Q.budget_2020_rebels = rebels > 0 ? 1 : 0;
    Q.budget_backing = Math.max(
        0,
        leftSeats ? Math.round((leftSeats - rebels) * 100 / leftSeats) : 0
    );
    Q.budget_vetoes = 0;
    Q.budget_package_code =
        Q.opposition_budget_priority_1_code == 5 ? 2 :
        (Q.opposition_budget_priority_1_code == 4 ? 3 :
        (Q.opposition_budget_tactic_code == 3 ? 4 : 1));
}
if (Q.annual_budget_year == 2021) Q.budget_2021_done = 1;
if (Q.annual_budget_year == 2022) Q.budget_2022_done = 1;
Q.news_headline = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? "The government's budget passes after a recorded opposition process"
    : "The government loses the budget vote without automatically losing office";

Q.opposition_budget_outcome = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? "Budget passed"
    : "Budget defeated";
const enactedCount = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? Q.opposition_budget_amendments_passed
    : 0;
Q.opposition_budget_sejm_clause_count = enactedCount;
Q.opposition_budget_sejm_clause = enactedCount > 0
    ? Q.annual_budget_concession
    : "None";
if (enactedCount == 2) {
    Q.opposition_budget_result_summary =
        "Lewica secured both named demands. Its Sejm line was: " +
        Q.annual_budget_posture + ".";
} else if (enactedCount == 1) {
    Q.opposition_budget_result_summary =
        "Lewica secured " + Q.opposition_budget_priority_1 +
        ". Its Sejm line was: " + Q.annual_budget_posture + ".";
} else if (Q.annual_budget_passed) {
    Q.opposition_budget_result_summary =
        "The budget passed without a Lewica clause. Its Sejm line was: " +
        Q.annual_budget_posture + ".";
} else {
    Q.opposition_budget_result_summary =
        "The budget failed. Cabinet acceptance cannot enact a clause from a " +
        "defeated bill.";
}
Q.opposition_budget_delivery_status = enactedCount > 0
    ? enactedCount + (enactedCount == 1 ? " clause is" : " clauses are") +
        " eligible for next year's delivery audit after the Senate stage. " +
        "Public capacity does not change today."
    : "No Lewica clause enters next year's delivery audit.";
Q.opposition_budget_next_step = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? "Next: Senate review. The Senate may propose amendments, but it cannot " +
        "reject a budget."
    : "Next: cabinet revision. The government remains in office while the " +
        "four-month Article 225 clock continues.";
!}

= [+ opposition_budget_outcome +]: [+ annual_budget_yes +]–[+ annual_budget_no +]

**[+ annual_budget_abstain +] abstained. [+ annual_budget_threshold +] yes votes
were required.**

Fiscal frame: **Social [+ annual_budget_social_share +]% · Defence [+ annual_budget_defence_share +]% · Deficit [+ annual_budget_deficit_share +]% GDP**.

<div class="ledger-notice">[+ opposition_budget_result_summary +]</div>

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">What your choice achieved</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Strategy</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_tactic +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Lewica line</span><b>[+ annual_budget_posture +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Clauses accepted by Sejm</span><b>[+ opposition_budget_sejm_clause_count +] of 2</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Delivery today</span><b>None</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">Accepted: [+ opposition_budget_sejm_clause +].</div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">[+ opposition_budget_delivery_status +]</div></div>

[? if opposition_budget_tactic_code = 2 or opposition_budget_tactic_code = 3:
<div class="ledger-section"><div class="ledger-title">Cabinet decisions</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>[+ opposition_budget_priority_1 +]</span><b>[? if opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed: Accepted?][? if not opposition_budget_amendment_1_passed: Refused?]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>[+ opposition_budget_priority_2 +]</span><b>[? if opposition_budget_amendment_2_passed: Accepted?][? if not opposition_budget_amendment_2_passed: Refused?]</b></div></div>?]

<details class="ledger-disclosure">
<summary><span>Full Sejm roll call</span><b>[+ annual_budget_yes +] yes · [+ annual_budget_no +] no · [+ annual_budget_abstain +] abstain</b></summary>
<div class="disclosure-body">
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Cabinet bloc</span><b>[+ annual_budget_government_yes +] yes · [+ annual_budget_government_abstain +] abstain</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Lewica</span><b>[+ annual_budget_left_yes +] yes · [+ annual_budget_left_no +] no · [+ annual_budget_left_abstain +] abstain</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Other clubs</span><b>[+ annual_budget_external_yes +] yes · [+ annual_budget_external_no +] no · [+ annual_budget_external_abstain +] abstain</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Required</span><b>[+ annual_budget_threshold +] yes</b></div>
<div class="ledger-note">[+ opposition_budget_external_support_basis +].</div>
[? if opposition_budget_rebel_count > 0: <div class="ledger-note">Lewica dissenters: [+ opposition_budget_named_rebels +].</div>?]
</div>
</details>

<div class="ledger-notice">[+ opposition_budget_next_step +]</div>

- @complete: Continue the budget procedure

@complete
go-to: poland_budget_2023_2026.opposition_budget_failed if annual_budget_passed = 0; poland_senate.budget_2019 if annual_budget_year = 2019 and annual_budget_passed = 1; poland_senate.budget_2020 if annual_budget_year = 2020 and annual_budget_passed = 1; poland_senate.budget_2021_2022 if annual_budget_year >= 2021 and annual_budget_passed = 1
